<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 29.07 to 5,933.97, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 2.36 to 370.54, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 25 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,630 to 762.</p>
<p>Volume was 439,253,810, compared with 418,735,640 Tuesday.</p>
